Error: Jet.CopyNotSupported: `Atomic<Int>` can't be copied
  --> Tests/UI/atomic_copy_noncloneable.jet:3:42
    |
  3 | copy_atomic: fn(value: Atomic<Int>) { _: value.copy() }
    |                                          ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: `Atomic<Int>` is `#MoveOnly`: its values move and never copy
 Fix: Move it instead with `.move()`; a second one has to come from wherever this one came from
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.CopyNotSupported
